<section class="pathways" id="pathways" aria-labelledby="pathways-heading">
  <div class="pathways__inner">
    <div class="pathways__header">
      <h2 class="pathways__headline" id="pathways-heading">What are you planning?</h2>
      <p class="pathways__intro">Start with who's going and what matters to you. We'll work through the ship, cabins, and itinerary together.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="pathways__grid">
      <article class="pathway">
        <h3 class="pathway__title">Your first cruise</h3>
        <p class="pathway__desc">There are a lot of ships, cabin types, and extras to compare. I'll help you narrow the choices around your dates, budget, and how you want to spend your time.</p>
        <p class="pathway__detail">Ship choice, cabin location, and what's included.</p>
        <a href="{{ site.links.consultation }}" class="pathway__link">Plan my first cruise <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
      </article>

      <article class="pathway">
        <h3 class="pathway__title">Bringing the family together</h3>
        <p class="pathway__desc">Kids, teenagers, and grandparents may want different things from the same trip. I'll help you compare cabins, activities, and dining arrangements with the whole group in mind.</p>
        <p class="pathway__detail">Cabins near each other, shared meals, and room for different paces.</p>
        <a href="{{ site.links.consultation }}" class="pathway__link">Plan a family cruise <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
      </article>

      <article class="pathway">
        <h3 class="pathway__title">A milestone or a cabin upgrade</h3>
        <p class="pathway__desc">An anniversary, a birthday, or a little more space this time. We'll weigh a balcony or suite against the itinerary and your budget, so you can decide where the extra spend matters.</p>
        <p class="pathway__detail">Cabin tradeoffs, time onboard, and plans for the occasion.</p>
        <a href="{{ site.links.consultation }}" class="pathway__link">Plan a special trip <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
